      "writtenOn": "2024-04-03T13:26:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We run tests in next (which is a good thing), so we need to not break those.\n\nAlthough if we ignore exceptions here as harmless, which I think we should, then I think we\u0027d be ok?",
      "parentUuid": "2ffa8648_b6337450",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 620,
        "startChar": 0,
