      },
      "lineNbr": 626,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-03T13:26:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Mmm, but deleting files is unlikely to fail unless they don\u0027t exist (which is a documented failure case) or something seriously weird is going on. And if the files still exist, the VM exists in some sense, and a subsequent get() might succeed. That\u0027s not true if a secret is stashed away somewhere.",
      "parentUuid": "4fd9d35d_0db35850",
